{"id":"dudoan-01","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-01/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":402.61,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.0,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two students called Sally and Steve discussing Sally's project on","words":[["Section",0.0,0.46],["3.",0.46,1.0],["You",1.54,2.32],["will",2.32,2.48],["hear",2.48,2.76],["two",2.76,3.06],["students",3.06,3.6],["called",3.6,4.16],["Sally",4.16,4.62],["and",4.62,4.92],["Steve",4.92,5.32],["discussing",5.32,6.24],["Sally's",6.24,7.06],["project",7.06,7.6],["on",7.6,8.0]]},{"start":8.0,"end":15.06,"text":"peer assessment, a system where students mark each other's work. First you have some time","words":[["peer",8.0,8.32],["assessment,",8.32,8.78],["a",9.58,9.8],["system",9.8,10.08],["where",10.08,10.46],["students",10.46,10.86],["mark",10.86,11.34],["each",11.34,11.56],["other's",11.56,11.94],["work.",11.94,12.26],["First",13.36,14.16],["you",14.16,14.38],["have",14.38,14.52],["some",14.52,14.7],["time",14.7,15.06]]},{"start":15.06,"end":52.92,"text":"to look at questions 21 to 24 on page 5. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21","words":[["to",15.06,15.28],["look",15.28,15.4],["at",15.4,15.52],["questions",15.52,15.84],["21",15.84,16.62],["to",16.62,16.84],["24",16.84,17.42],["on",17.42,18.28],["page",18.28,18.58],["5.",18.58,19.12],["Now",49.6,49.96],["listen",49.96,50.34],["carefully",50.34,50.76],["and",50.76,51.18],["answer",51.18,51.58],["questions",51.58,51.96],["21",51.96,52.92]]},{"start":52.92,"end":53.78,"text":"to 24.","words":[["to",52.92,53.18],["24.",53.18,53.78]]},{"start":53.78,"end":62.77,"text":"I can't believe you're still in the library Sally. You've been here all day. Are you still","words":[["I",53.78,54.72],["can't",57.57,57.87],["believe",57.87,58.11],["you're",58.11,58.41],["still",58.41,58.67],["in",58.67,58.87],["the",58.87,58.99],["library",58.99,59.37],["Sally.",59.37,59.79],["You've",60.43,60.73],["been",60.73,60.89],["here",60.89,61.05],["all",61.05,61.23],["day.",61.23,61.57],["Are",62.23,62.41],["you",62.41,62.53],["still",62.53,62.77]]},{"start":62.77,"end":64.55,"text":"working on your peer assessment project?","words":[["working",62.77,63.07],["on",63.07,63.29],["your",63.29,63.41],["peer",63.41,63.69],["assessment",63.69,64.11],["project?",64.11,64.55]]},{"start":65.05,"end":71.13,"text":"Hi Steve. Yes I'm still here and I'm nowhere near finished. I'm still processing the reading","words":[["Hi",65.05,65.29],["Steve.",65.29,65.61],["Yes",66.13,66.35],["I'm",66.35,66.67],["still",66.67,66.99],["here",66.99,67.29],["and",67.29,67.45],["I'm",67.45,67.63],["nowhere",67.63,67.97],["near",67.97,68.37],["finished.",68.37,68.85],["I'm",69.69,69.85],["still",69.85,70.03],["processing",70.03,70.61],["the",70.61,70.83],["reading",70.83,71.13]]},{"start":71.13,"end":76.07,"text":"I've done on peer assessment. I'm interested to see if students marking each other's","words":[["I've",71.13,71.41],["done",71.41,71.57],["on",71.57,71.73],["peer",71.73,71.93],["assessment.",71.93,72.43],["I'm",73.17,73.41],["interested",73.41,73.73],["to",73.73,74.01],["see",74.01,74.23],["if",74.23,74.35],["students",74.35,74.73],["marking",74.73,75.29],["each",75.29,75.61],["other's",75.61,76.07]]},{"start":76.07,"end":80.89,"text":"work is beneficial. I know a lot of the other students are pretty skeptical about","words":[["work",76.07,76.33],["is",76.33,76.59],["beneficial.",76.59,77.11],["I",77.85,78.11],["know",78.11,78.29],["a",78.29,78.41],["lot",78.41,78.53],["of",78.53,78.75],["the",78.75,78.87],["other",78.87,79.03],["students",79.03,79.51],["are",79.51,79.75],["pretty",79.75,80.01],["skeptical",80.01,80.49],["about",80.49,80.89]]},{"start":80.89,"end":86.61,"text":"its value as a way of assessing their performance. They think the tutors are in favour of","words":[["its",80.89,81.21],["value",81.21,81.71],["as",81.71,82.29],["a",82.29,82.41],["way",82.41,82.53],["of",82.53,82.69],["assessing",82.69,83.09],["their",83.09,83.35],["performance.",83.35,83.87],["They",84.55,84.77],["think",84.77,84.99],["the",84.99,85.15],["tutors",85.15,85.61],["are",85.61,85.85],["in",85.85,85.95],["favour",85.95,86.27],["of",86.27,86.61]]},{"start":86.61,"end":92.05,"text":"it, because they don't have to spend so long marking. But I disagree. I think we can learn","words":[["it,",86.61,86.77],["because",86.95,87.29],["they",87.29,87.51],["don't",87.51,87.75],["have",87.75,87.91],["to",87.91,88.07],["spend",88.07,88.31],["so",88.31,88.63],["long",88.63,88.83],["marking.",88.83,89.31],["But",89.65,90.17],["I",90.17,90.35],["disagree.",90.35,90.61],["I",91.21,91.41],["think",91.41,91.59],["we",91.59,91.75],["can",91.75,91.91],["learn",91.91,92.05]]},{"start":92.05,"end":93.25,"text":"a great deal from it.","words":[["a",92.05,92.21],["great",92.21,92.41],["deal",92.41,92.69],["from",92.69,92.97],["it.",92.97,93.25]]},{"start":93.49,"end":99.09,"text":"Yes. I can see one advantage being that it saves time spent going over things in class.","words":[["Yes.",93.49,93.99],["I",94.61,94.87],["can",94.87,95.01],["see",95.01,95.21],["one",95.21,95.49],["advantage",95.49,96.01],["being",96.01,96.35],["that",96.35,96.57],["it",96.57,96.69],["saves",96.69,96.97],["time",96.97,97.29],["spent",97.29,97.59],["going",97.59,97.99],["over",97.99,98.27],["things",98.27,98.49],["in",98.49,98.69],["class.",98.69,99.09]]},{"start":99.57,"end":104.57,"text":"Well, initially it doesn't seem to work that way, and it can be quite a time-consuming","words":[["Well,",99.57,99.93],["initially",100.09,100.49],["it",100.49,100.87],["doesn't",100.87,101.23],["seem",101.23,101.43],["to",101.43,101.59],["work",101.59,101.81],["that",101.81,102.01],["way,",102.01,102.29],["and",102.61,102.91],["it",102.91,103.05],["can",103.05,103.27],["be",103.27,103.47],["quite",103.47,103.71],["a",103.71,103.85],["time",103.85,104.11],["-consuming",104.11,104.57]]},{"start":104.57,"end":109.25,"text":"business, because sometimes things have to be marked again if the tutor thinks the","words":[["business,",104.57,105.13],["because",105.57,105.87],["sometimes",105.87,106.37],["things",106.37,106.71],["have",106.71,106.97],["to",106.97,107.09],["be",107.09,107.23],["marked",107.23,107.49],["again",107.49,107.95],["if",107.95,108.25],["the",108.25,108.41],["tutor",108.41,108.69],["thinks",108.69,108.99],["the",108.99,109.25]]},{"start":109.25,"end":114.33,"text":"student's assessments aren't reliable. The real gain is the fact that the students","words":[["student's",109.25,109.91],["assessments",109.91,110.33],["aren't",110.33,110.87],["reliable.",110.87,111.33],["The",112.03,112.33],["real",112.33,112.65],["gain",112.65,112.93],["is",112.93,113.23],["the",113.23,113.41],["fact",113.41,113.59],["that",113.59,113.79],["the",113.79,113.95],["students",113.95,114.33]]},{"start":114.33,"end":119.77,"text":"learn to stand back and assess their own assignments objectively because they're","words":[["learn",114.33,114.67],["to",114.67,115.01],["stand",115.01,115.29],["back",115.29,115.73],["and",115.73,116.45],["assess",116.45,116.81],["their",116.81,117.11],["own",117.11,117.39],["assignments",117.39,117.91],["objectively",117.91,118.59],["because",118.59,119.49],["they're",119.49,119.77]]},{"start":119.77,"end":124.57,"text":"much more familiar with the marking system. Yes, I can see that. It gives them","words":[["much",119.77,120.01],["more",120.01,120.25],["familiar",120.25,120.67],["with",120.67,120.95],["the",120.95,121.11],["marking",121.11,121.37],["system.",121.37,121.87],["Yes,",122.17,122.53],["I",122.73,122.83],["can",122.83,122.99],["see",122.99,123.25],["that.",123.25,123.49],["It",124.01,124.17],["gives",124.17,124.39],["them",124.39,124.57]]},{"start":124.57,"end":129.41,"text":"an opportunity to reflect on their own performance and how do they feel about","words":[["an",124.57,124.71],["opportunity",124.71,125.15],["to",125.15,125.51],["reflect",125.51,125.91],["on",125.91,126.19],["their",126.19,126.35],["own",126.35,126.57],["performance",126.57,127.05],["and",127.05,127.99],["how",127.99,128.65],["do",128.65,128.75],["they",128.75,128.89],["feel",128.89,129.15],["about",129.15,129.41]]},{"start":129.41,"end":135.41,"text":"having another student mark their work? Is that good for rapport? In some cases yes,","words":[["having",129.41,129.77],["another",129.77,130.13],["student",130.13,130.57],["mark",130.57,130.93],["their",130.93,131.17],["work?",131.17,131.65],["Is",132.09,132.41],["that",132.41,132.59],["good",132.59,132.73],["for",132.73,132.91],["rapport?",132.91,133.21],["In",133.85,134.09],["some",134.09,134.49],["cases",134.49,134.97],["yes,",134.97,135.41]]},{"start":135.85,"end":141.53,"text":"in some cases no. I think more research is needed to answer that question. What","words":[["in",135.85,136.03],["some",136.03,136.31],["cases",136.31,136.67],["no.",136.67,137.09],["I",137.83,137.99],["think",137.99,138.19],["more",138.19,138.45],["research",138.45,138.97],["is",138.97,139.13],["needed",139.13,139.45],["to",139.45,139.71],["answer",139.71,139.95],["that",139.95,140.17],["question.",140.17,140.65],["What",141.17,141.53]]},{"start":141.53,"end":146.27,"text":"What happens if a tutor notices that the marks for a particular assignment seem wrong?","words":[["What",141.53,141.53],["happens",141.53,141.91],["if",141.91,142.17],["a",142.17,142.33],["tutor",142.33,142.59],["notices",142.59,143.21],["that",143.21,143.63],["the",143.63,143.77],["marks",143.77,144.09],["for",144.09,144.33],["a",144.33,144.47],["particular",144.47,144.77],["assignment",144.77,145.47],["seem",145.47,145.89],["wrong?",145.89,146.27]]},{"start":147.07,"end":148.45,"text":"Should the students mark them again?","words":[["Should",147.07,147.27],["the",147.27,147.43],["students",147.43,147.73],["mark",147.73,148.03],["them",148.03,148.17],["again?",148.17,148.45]]},{"start":148.87,"end":150.51,"text":"That might not make any difference.","words":[["That",148.87,149.15],["might",149.15,149.41],[